    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061123.0334\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 24 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nXinhua international news advisory -- Nov.24\n\n\n\n\nThe following are some of the major international news stories scheduled to be covered or pursued by Xinhua on Friday.\n\n-- Hu Jintao meets with Pakistani President.\n\n-- Hu Jintao delivers speech in Pakistan.\n\n-- Putin rules out expansion ban on Polish meat to entire EU.\n\n-- Spain, China sign agreement on the environment.\n\n-- Mexico launches action plan as cold weather bites.",
